OL,3,GNEWSAPraise for specatators at city's
OL,4,Ahalf marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FRunners in the 20th Potters 'Arf
OL,7,FMarathon in Stoke-on-Trent have praised
OL,8,Fthe support they received from the
OL,9,Flocal community.
OL,11,FMore than 2,000 people took part in the
OL,12,Frun, which was started by the former
OL,13,FStoke City manager, Lou Macari,
OL,14,Falongside Great British long jumper,
OL,15,FJazmin Sawyers.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
