OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAPraise for specatators at city's
OL,4,Ahalf marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FSawyers, who is from Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,7,Fsaid: "Coming into the city centre
OL,8,Ftoday and seeing how many people not
OL,9,Fonly have showed up to run but have
OL,10,Fshowed up to support the runners, it
OL,11,Fjust shows the power of sport to bring
OL,12,Fcommunities together."
OL,14,FMacari added: "It was great to see so
OL,15,Fmany people up in Hanley".
